4,0,,status,George,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""WEREWOLF"",""alive"":true}"
5,0,1,talk,Rin,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm so excited to find the werewolf! I'm going to be the best detective ever and save the village! Who do you guys think is suspicious?,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,"It is a bit early to be calling anyone suspicious, Rin. Let us all take a deep breath and observe each other calmly first. Experience tells me that haste often leads to mistakes.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with George. It's too early to say anything. I'll just... try my best to help everyone.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. Let us be kind to one another as we search for the werewolf. I believe a gentle approach will serve us best in these troubled times.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,It's nice to meet everyone. I agree with George and Shizue; let's start calmly and get to know each other first. I'll do my best to support you all!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"But I can't help it! I'm just so curious! @George, you sound like a teacher. Do you have a secret plan to catch the werewolf? Tell me, tell me!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"No secret plans, Rin. I simply believe in the power of observation. I intend to listen to everyone's words and see if any contradictions emerge as the days pass. Patience is a virtue in these matters.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think that's a good way to do it. I'm not very good at this, but I'll listen carefully too. I hope we can all get along.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"You are such a sweet soul, Daisuke. Please do not be so hard on yourself. We are all here to help each other, and your kindness is a wonderful gift to the village.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, please don't be so nervous! We're all in this together, and your honesty is really refreshing. I'm sure you'll be a great help to us all.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,"Hehe, everyone is being so polite! It's almost too quiet. Maybe the werewolf is hiding behind all these nice words! @Midori, do you think the werewolf is pretending to be a good person?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,"It is a possibility, Rin, but we must be careful not to let suspicion cloud our judgment. If we assume everyone is lying, we will only create chaos. Let us remain composed and observant.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't know. I guess anyone could be pretending... but I want to believe everyone is being sincere. I'll just... keep watching and listening.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"It is a very natural feeling to be cautious, but let us not forget the warmth in our hearts. I believe that by trusting one another, we can find the truth without losing our peace.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,"That's a good point, Rin, but I think Shizue is right. Trusting each other helps us stay calm. I'll keep an eye out for anything strange, but let's try to keep the harmony for now.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,"Okay! I'll try to be patient like George, but I'm still going to keep my detective eyes wide open! I'm ready for tomorrow! Let's see what happens!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,George,,I believe we have established a good foundation for the days ahead. I shall spend the night reflecting on our conversation.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll do the same. I hope everyone has a peaceful night. I'll try to be more helpful tomorrow.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"Sleep well, my dear friends. May your dreams be peaceful and your hearts be light. I shall be thinking of you all.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Midori,,"I hope everyone has a wonderful night's rest. I'm looking forward to seeing how we can all work together tomorrow. Goodnight, everyone!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
