31,1,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""SEER"",""alive"":true}"
32,1,,status,Daisuke,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""VILLAGER"",""alive"":true}"
33,1,,status,Midori,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""VILLAGER"",""alive"":true}"
34,1,,status,Rin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""POSSESSED"",""alive"":true}"
35,1,,status,George,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""WEREWOLF"",""alive"":true}"
36,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Good morning, everyone! I slept great! Now that it's Day 1, does anyone have any super secret clues? Did the Seer find something scary last night? Tell me, tell me!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,George,,"Let us not rush into things, Rin. If the Seer has information, they will share it when they feel it is the most strategic moment. For now, let us see if anyone feels an instinctive unease.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't really have any instincts like that. I'm just... a bit worried. I hope the Seer found something that can help us without anyone getting hurt.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"My heart is heavy, for I must share a very sad truth. George, I am afraid you are the werewolf. It pains me to say this, but my divination was quite clear.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Oh my, Shizue! That is quite a shock. @George, what do you have to say to that? I really hope there's some kind of misunderstanding, but we have to take the Seer's words seriously.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Rin,,"Whoa! Shizue is the Seer?! That's so cool! But George is the werewolf? No way! He seemed so calm and teacher-like! @George, are you really a big bad wolf? Tell us the truth!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,George,,"This is a most unexpected turn of events. Shizue, I am deeply saddened that you would see me in such a light. I assure you, I am a simple villager. I believe you are mistaken, or perhaps someone is deceiving us.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I can't believe it. George seemed so kind and wise... but if Shizue is the Seer, then... I don't know what to do. This is all so scary. Is it really true?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is a very difficult position to be in, Daisuke, and I feel your fear. However, the vision I saw was unmistakable. George, my heart truly hopes I am wrong, but I must be honest for the safety of our village.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Midori,,"It's a very difficult situation for everyone. @George, your composure is usually so reassuring, but if Shizue is the Seer, her information is our most reliable tool. Do you have any reason to believe she's lying?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm so confused! If George is the werewolf, he's a really good actor! But Shizue is so gentle, I can't imagine her lying. @George, why are you being so quiet? You have to tell us something more convincing!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,George,,"I am not being quiet, Rin; I am simply processing this absurdity. Shizue, your kindness is well-known, but claiming I am the werewolf so early is a bold move. It is far more likely that the werewolf is pretending to be the Seer.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I don't know who to believe. George's point makes sense, but Shizue seems so sincere... I'm really scared of making a mistake and hurting someone innocent. What should we do?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"My dear Daisuke, it is only natural to feel afraid when trust is shaken. But please, look into my eyes. I would never deceive you or this village. I only wish for us all to be safe and at peace.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, it's okay to be scared, but we have to make a decision. George, your logic about a fake Seer is a possibility, but Shizue's sincerity is very strong. It's a heartbreaking choice, but we must prioritize the village's safety.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""George"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm torn! I want to believe George, but Shizue is so sweet! If we vote for George and he's innocent, I'll feel terrible! But if he's the wolf, we win! I'll trust Shizue's magic eyes! Vote George!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,George,,"It is a tragedy that you have all been so easily swayed. I have tried to guide you with patience and reason, but it seems my experience is no match for a convincing facade. I accept your decision, though it is a grave error.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'm so sorry, George. I really didn't want to believe it, but I have to trust Shizue. I can't let the werewolf stay among us. Please... please forgive me. I'll vote for George.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"It is a heavy burden to bear, and my heart aches for the sadness this brings. George, please know that I hold no ill will toward you, but I must do what is right for everyone. I forgive you, and I hope you can forgive me.","{""words"":46,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Midori,,"It's so sad that it has to end this way. George, I'm truly sorry, but we have to trust the Seer's information to protect the village. I'll vote for George.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
